clueweb09-en0007-52-12727.0 Dogsled.com: Mushing news, Iditarod, Yukon Quest, sled dog events Top News Reviews Events Mushing FAQs Forum Login Form Username Password Remember me Lost Password? No account yet? Register Main Menu Home Search Events Calendar Photo Gallery Musher Profiles Musher Tributes Classifieds Links About Us Contact Us Sitemap Iditarod Videos Latest News Mackey not running the 2009 Quest Noatak 120 Mush to Donate Program Welcome to Winter video Yukon Quest Tugline Popular Everything Iditarod Mushing terminology/dictionary Pretty Sled Dogs DVD Susan Butcher's Daughter leads off Iditarod 2007 Cantwell Classic Race Results images from the dogsled group :: www.flickr.com Join Dave Monson in run for Leukemia and Lymphoma [PDF] [Print] [E-mail] Written by Dave Monson Thursday, 06 September 2007 [davemonsonmarathon]Dear Friends - It is hard for me to believe that it has been a year since Susan died. This August would have been our 22nd wedding anniversary. I cannot help but reflect on all the memories she left me with along with our two beautiful girls Tekla and Chisana. I was truly blessed to have shared a life with her. Even though Susan is gone, the awful disease that took her from all of us is still inflicting its pain on others.
