clueweb09-en0009-03-33464.0 [] [] Peanut Butter Cookie Recipes Here is a collection of Peanut Butter Cookie recipes from Gramma Cookie's Kitchen. Please enjoy these recipes and if you have any favourite Peanut Butter Cookie recipes that you would like to share with our many visitors please send them to us and we would be happy to include them in our collection. Peanut Butter Balls 1 cup crunchy peanut butter 2 tablespoons butter fine coconut 1 cup icing sugar 1 cup Rice Krispies butter icing Combine the peanut butter, icing sugar, and butter. Mix well. Mix in the Rice Krispies. Form into 1 inch balls. Roll in the butter icing. Roll in the coconut. Refrigerate before eating. Chocolate Chip Peanut Butter Cookie Recipe 1 cup shortening 3/4 cup brown sugar 3/4 cup white sugar 2 eggs 1 cup chunky peanut butter 1/2 cup chocolate chips 2 cup sifted flour 1 1/2 teaspoon baking soda 1/4 teaspoon salt Cream the shortening and peanut butter until light and fluffy. Add sugar and mix some more. Add the eggs, mix until light and fluffy. Add other ingredients and mix well. Roll into balls and drop on ungreased cookie sheet, flatten with a floured fork. Bake for
